                <head>Multilateral convention on northwest Atlantic fisheries</head>
                <p>[Convention signed at Washington February 8, 1949, by Canada, Denmark, France
                    (with a reservation), Iceland, Italy, Newfoundland, Norway, Portugal, Spain
                    (with a reservation), the United Kingdom and the United States. For text of
                    Convention, which entered into force July 3, 1950, and which was proclaimed by
                    the President of the United States July 17, 1950, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >United States Treaties and Other International Agreements</hi> (UST),
                    volume 1, page 177.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
